{"slug": "jobright", "name": "Jobright", "category": "AI & LLM Platforms", "summary": "AI job-hunting platform. Spring-mint green, black pill buttons, condensed Titillium headlines", "description": "An analysis of Jobright's design language — an AI job-hunting platform built on an energetic spring-mint green against black and white, with pale-mint section bands carrying the page rhythm. Bold condensed Titillium Web display headings pair with a clean Inter UI, and the CTA system runs on high-contrast pill buttons — black pills for primary actions, a mint-green pill for the signature accent. Rounded product-mockup cards, a scrolling black job ticker, and generous whitespace give it a friendly, high-energy startup feel.", "colors": [{"name": "Spring Mint", "hex": "#00f0a0", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary", "role": "the brand's one electric accent. Colors the logo mark, links, the signature green pill button, score highlights, and inline emphasis."}, {"name": "On-Primary", "hex": "#000000", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "on-primary", "role": "black label used on top of the mint-green button, where dark-on-mint reads with maximum punch."}, {"name": "Canvas", "hex": "#ffffff", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas", "role": "default page and card background."}, {"name": "Mint Canvas", "hex": "#ecffe0", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas-mint", "role": "the pale spring-mint band that carries the hero, feature blocks, FAQ, and CTA sections — the system's dominant surface."}, {"name": "Soft Surface", "hex": "#f2f4f5", "group": "Surface", "token": "surface-soft", "role": "light gray utility fill for inset panels and inputs."}, {"name": "Hairline", "hex": "#e5e7eb", "group": "Surface", "token": "hairline", "role": "1px card and divider borders."}, {"name": "Ink", "hex": "#000000", "group": "Text", "token": "ink", "role": "headings, body text, and the fill of every black pill button and dark band."}, {"name": "Muted", "hex": "#86909c", "group": "Text", "tok